    {
      "id": 252525,
      "name": "",
      "username": "skywhale",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/skywhale/{size}/5248_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-05-09T14:03:01.275Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Progeny is one of the hardest fights, so unfortunately a lot of the advice is mostly to just cheese him.</p>\n<p>Since he’s a single source of damage, anything that stops him from doing his thing is extremely powerful (I think Legacy, Wraith, and Tachyon are best for that from what you have - especially preventing him from dealing damage). Other than that, he’s generally a real quick fight and so you want to just maximize damage, so take a big hitter or two (Ra of course, and Wraith can double for this as well).</p>\n<p>If I were to make a team right now for the fight, it would probably be: Legacy, Argent Adept, Tachyon, Wraith, and Ra.</p>\n<p>Probably want a friendly environment too. Or Wagner Mars Base, since it has a chance to make everyone immune and make his turn pointless (and maybe give you time to set up).</p>",
      "post_number": 4,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2023-05-09T14:28:14.105Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": 3,
