    {
      "id": 252527,
      "name": "",
      "username": "fjur",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/fjur/{size}/4849_2.png",
      "created_at": "2023-05-09T14:24:47.461Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Progeny’s front side deals mainly Energy damage, so Captain Cosmic’s Cosmic Crest or Legacy’s Next Evolution will likely help.</p>\n<p>And since his flipped side mainly attacks the hero with the lowest HP, The Visionary in her Cocoon or NightMist in Mist Form could tank those hits for awhile before another hero gets lower.</p>",
