      "created_at": "2023-05-09T21:45:26.578Z",
      "cooked": "<p>There’s some strategy involved in which Scions you leave in play when given the option to destroy one. Personally, I like to get rid of anything that allows villains to play more cards as highest priority. Depending on your damage-dealing ability, you might have to think about which of the others are better or worse.</p>",
